PRIVATE PRACTICE PHYSICIANS:
Do yourself a favor, do not see Medicare advantage plans. On one EOB a Medicare advantage insurance company denied two codes 99489 and  G2212.  These codes reflect time and effort and additional work that I did that they bundle and won’t pay for. Just see Medicare or a commercial insurer that pays better.  And that’s not the only stuff they bundle and don’t pay for !
@AIMPA_US @MedEconomics @aao_ophth
